1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
One sky. On Lantern Festival night —
people honour the Heaven Official.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
It’s also the Upper Yuan Festival: the
Heaven Official’s birthday.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
He’s also called Ziwei Dadi — the same
name as the northern sky’s centre, the
Ziwei Enclosure.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,000
One is a god, the other a star region —
the Sky Emperor’s palace, pivot of the
sky.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Outside its walls sits the Big Dipper.
Sima Qian called it the Sky Emperor’s
chariot.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,000
After dark, spot a nearly full Moon with
Jupiter and Mars close by.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Belarus: a farmer’s sky and Elijah’s
chariot.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Follow for a new sky every week.

